# Saga of the Adventurer (Q079) on the saga core, played by a level 76 Treasure Hunter from
# the start: Black Cat offers it and gives the main item; Klaus sends the player to Valentine,
# who asks for what the player does not hold; Black Cat has nothing more to say until the
# tablets are done, and a relog keeps the journal. Expectations are the reference trace's
# (the relog's rows and state derived from ThirdClassQuest.java and Q079_SagaOfTheAdventurer.java).
